# ─── RAVENBOT data root ───
# This repository is checked out at ~/RAVENBOT, which is also the app's data
# root, so the runtime's own directories land inside the working tree. Nothing
# under these is source: they are agent workspaces, and a suite that runs an
# agent creates a folder per bot. Committing them would put generated work into
# history and leave a nested `projects/git/.git` to trip `git add -A`.
projects/
config/
logs/
cache/
keys/
